plan:
{"explanation":"Plan to satisfy the two requests in parallel.

Blinds: I will try to close the available covers (blinds_308e cover, blackout_blinds_308e cover, and window_308e cover) in parallel. Each cover uses an idempotent selector: first check the cover's current state (property endpoint). If it is already 'closed' the condition succeeds and no action is called; otherwise the plan calls the cover/close_cover action for that cover.

Lights ("Dim the lights"): The system can only reliably change brightness on devices that expose a brightness control. Of the lights present, desk_lamp_308e supports a brightness_pct parameter, so the plan will set that lamp to 30% (LightTurnOn with brightness_pct=30). The selector first checks the lamp's current numeric brightness and skips the action if it is already at or below 30. The other lights (ambient_lights_308e and task_lights_308e) do not expose a brightness_pct control in their available affordances, so I cannot directly "dim" them with the provided affordances. They could still be toggled on/off, but that is different from dimming. If you want me to also attempt a lower-level workaround (for example: turn those lights on with a lower brightness if/when supported, or turn them off), tell me which behavior you prefer and a target brightness for all dimmable lights if 30% is not what you want.","intent_type":"IMPLICIT","intents":[{"action":"set","artifact":"blinds","intent_text":"Close the blinds","parameter":"open_close","value":false},{"action":"modify","artifact":"light","intent_text":"Dim the lights","parameter":"brightness"}],"plan_type":"behavior_tree","tree":{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"expected_value":"closed","name":"CheckStateIsclosed","operator":"==","property_url":"http://localhost:8080/workspaces/lab308e/artifacts/blinds_308e_cover/properties/state","type":"condition"},{"action_url":"http://localhost:8080/workspaces/lab308e/artifacts/blinds_308e_cover/ha/cover/close_cover","name":"CloseCover","type":"action"}],"name":"Selector_3","type":"selector"},{"children":[{"expected_value":"closed","name":"CheckStateIsclosed","operator":"==","property_url":"http://localhost:8080/workspaces/lab308e/artifacts/blackout_blinds_308e_cover/properties/state","type":"condition"},{"action_url":"http://localhost:8080/workspaces/lab308e/artifacts/blackout_blinds_308e_cover/ha/cover/close_cover","name":"CloseCover","type":"action"}],"name":"Selector_4","type":"selector"},{"children":[{"expected_value":"closed","name":"CheckStateIsclosed","operator":"==","property_url":"http://localhost:8080/workspaces/lab308e/artifacts/window_308e_cover/properties/state","type":"condition"},{"action_url":"http://localhost:8080/workspaces/lab308e/artifacts/window_308e_cover/ha/cover/close_cover","name":"CloseCover","type":"action"}],"name":"Selector_5","type":"selector"}],"name":"Parallel_2","policy":"success_on_all","type":"parallel"},{"children":[{"children":[{"expected_value":30,"name":"CheckBrightnessIs30","operator":"<=","property_url":"http://localhost:8080/workspaces/lab308e/artifacts/desk_lamp_308e/properties/brightness","type":"condition"},{"action_url":"http://localhost:8080/workspaces/lab308e/artifacts/desk_lamp_308e/ha/light/turn_on","name":"TurnOn","parameters":{"brightness_pct":30},"type":"action"}],"name":"Selector_7","type":"selector"}],"name":"Parallel_6","policy":"success_on_all","type":"parallel"}],"name":"Parallel_1","policy":"success_on_all","type":"parallel"},"workspace_id":"lab308e"}
